          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said to Moses, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.35.4+EXO.35.5+EXO.35.6+EXO.35.7+EXO.35.8+EXO.35.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ex 35.4-9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Speak to the people of Israel, that they take for me an offering; from every man whose heart makes him willing you shall receive the offering for me. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And this is the offering which you shall receive from them: gold, silver, and bronze, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "blue and purple and scarlet stuff and fine twined linen, goats' hair, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tanned rams' skins, goatskins, acacia wood, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oil for the lamps, spices for the anointing oil and for the fragrant incense, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "onyx stones, and stones for setting, for the ephod and for the breastpiece. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And let them make me a sanctuary, that I may dwell in their midst. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "According to all that I show you concerning the pattern of the tabernacle, and of all its furniture, so you shall make it.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.37.1+EXO.37.2+EXO.37.3+EXO.37.4+EXO.37.5+EXO.37.6+EXO.37.7+EXO.37.8+EXO.37.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ex 37.1-9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “They shall make an ark of acacia wood; two cubits and a half shall be its length, a cubit and a half its breadth, and a cubit and a half its height. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And you shall overlay it with pure gold, within and without shall you overlay it, and you shall make upon it a molding of gold round about. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And you shall cast four rings of gold for it and put them on its four feet, two rings on the one side of it, and two rings on the other side of it. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You shall make poles of acacia wood, and overlay them with gold. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And you shall put the poles into the rings on the sides of the ark, to carry the ark by them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The poles shall remain in the rings of the ark; they shall not be taken from it. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And you shall put into the ark the testimony which I shall give you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then you shall make a mercy seat",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25.17",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "cover",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " of pure gold; two cubits and a half shall be its length, and a cubit and a half its breadth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And you shall make two cherubim of gold; of hammered work shall you make them, on the two ends of the mercy seat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Make one cherub on the one end, and one cherub on the other end; of one piece with the mercy seat shall you make the cherubim on its two ends. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The cherubim shall spread out their wings above, overshadowing the mercy seat with their wings, their faces one to another; toward the mercy seat shall the faces of the cherubim be. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And you shall put the mercy seat on the top of the ark; and in the ark you shall put the testimony that I shall give you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "There I will meet with you, and from above the mercy seat, from between the two cherubim that are upon the ark of the testimony, I will speak with you of all that I will give you in commandment for the people of Israel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
